@host = http://localhost:5080

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Listar tableros
GET {{host}}/api/boards

### Obtener el tablero de demostración
GET {{host}}/api/boards/8a1b2c3d-4e5f-4a6b-8c7d-9e0f1a2b3c4d

### Crear una tarjeta en "Por hacer"
POST {{host}}/api/cards
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "columnId": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
  "title": "Nueva tarea de ejemplo",
  "description": "Creada desde el archivo .http"
}

### Mover la tarjeta "Definir el alcance del MVP" a "En progreso"
PUT {{host}}/api/cards/move
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "boardId": "8a1b2c3d-4e5f-4a6b-8c7d-9e0f1a2b3c4d",
  "cardId": "aaaaaaa1-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaa1",
  "targetColumnId": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
  "newPosition": 1
}